---
// The site is dark only. Its palette, the voxel and rounds figures and the Mermaid theme are all made for a
// dark page, and only the tokens in src/styles/starlight.css are set; Starlight's light theme applied over
// them left a white header above a dark page, with the theme picker's label all but invisible. Readers
// whose system asks for light, or who once picked it, get the dark page too.
---

{/* Inline, as Starlight's own provider is, so the page never flashes another theme. */}
<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
	try {
		localStorage.removeItem('starlight-theme');
	} catch {}
	window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
